{"seq":1,"slug":"spacex-milestones","title":"SpaceX 的里程碑","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/major-works/spacex-milestones","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"falcon-and-dragon","title":"猎鹰火箭与龙飞船","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/major-works/spacex-milestones/falcon-and-dragon","wordCount":1587,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"starship-and-starlink","title":"星舰与星链","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/major-works/spacex-milestones/starship-and-starlink","wordCount":1365,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# SpaceX 的里程碑\n\n马斯克的代表成就，首先体现在 SpaceX 一系列改变航天的里程碑产品上。本章聚焦其中最具标志性的造物。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"猎鹰火箭与龙飞船\"——它们如何让 SpaceX 从初创公司成长为商业航天巨头。第二篇文档讲述\"星舰与星链\",呈现承载火星梦想的星舰，与构建全球太空互联网的星链。\n"}